<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Airborne Freight raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Airborne Freight raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon, Read said analyst John Pincavage upgraded Airborne Freight Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- In a report, cited &quot;excellent&quot; first quarter earnings well above forecasts.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $2.37 from $1.85 and 1998 to $2.40 from $2.15.</p>
</text>
